  "instructions": [
    "Heat butter in a hot pot vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add cumin seeds and let them sizzle for a few seconds.",
    "Add chopped onion, grated ginger, and minced garlic and saut\u00131 until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add chopped green chilies and cook for another minute.",
    "Add coriander powder, garam masala powder, and salt. Stir well.",
    "Add the spinach and cook until it's wilted.",
    "Add the paneer, cranberry juice, and milk. Stir well to combine.",
    "Add the flour and stir to thicken the mixture.",
    "Reduce heat to low and let it simmer for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Stir in some extra butter if the mixture becomes too thick.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh cilantro.",
    "Serve with naan or rice for a complete meal."
  ],
